#: Behler.md:1
msgid "Implementing Behler-Parinello symmetry functions"
msgstr "Behler-Parinello Symmetry Functions の実装"

#: Behler.md:3
msgid ""
"There are other codes that implement the [Behler-Parinello symmetry "
"functions](https://pubs.aip.org/aip/jcp/article/134/7/074106/954787/Atom-"
"centered-symmetry-functions-for-constructing) and to my knowledge no one has"
" used these functions as a CV for a metadynamics simulation. It is, "
"therefore, not unreasonable to ask if an implementation of these CVs in "
"PLUMED is really necessary. The implementation I will describe below was "
"done relatively quickly and I hope it demonstrates how new functionality can"
" be quickly prototyped in the modified version of PLUMED that I have "
"described in these pages."
msgstr ""
"[Behler-Parinello Symmetry "
"Functions](https://pubs.aip.org/aip/jcp/article/134/7/074106/954787/Atom-"
"centered-symmetry-functions-for-constructing) は他のコードにもあり、私の知る限り Metadynamics"
" CV には使われていません。PLUMED "
"に必要かという問いは妥当ですが、以下は比較的短時間で実装できました。改良版で新機能を迅速に試作できることを示したいと思います。"

