#: Behler.md:66
msgid ""
"Notice the flexibility of this implementation for the Behler symmetry "
"function you can basically compute any weighted function of the bond vectors"
" in the first coordination sphere using an input like this one. A similar "
"input (see below) could be used to calculate the FCC cubic parameter:"
